<!-- Plan Highlights -->
<section class="plan_highlight what_covered">
	<article class="container">
					<h3>Plan Highlights</h3>
				<ul class="bullets">
			                <ul>
	<li>Cumulative Bonus Super boosts your Sum Insured to 7x in five years, even if you claim.</li>
	<li>Unlimited Automatic recharge if you exhaust the sum insured anytime during the year.</li>
	<li>No sub-limits on hospitalisation, AYUSH treatment, advanced technology procedures, etc.</li>
	<li>Up to 30% discounts on renewal premiums to encourage you to stay physically active.</li>
	<li>Unlimited E-consultations with discounts on Diagnostics, Pharmacy, &amp; Consultations.</li>
	<li>Optional coverage for in-clinic OPD consultations with physicians and specialists.</li>
</ul>

					</ul>
	</article>
</section>


