			<a href="https://cms.careinsurance.com/cms/public/uploads/download_center/care-supreme---policy-terms-and-conditions.pdf?rv=0.71672700%201668687223" class="download_url" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Download Terms and Conditions</a>
		</aside>
		<aside class="tab_content exclusion_section" id="tab2">
							<ul class="bullets">
	<li>
	<p>Any OPD Treatment</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Expenses attributable to suicide, attempted suicide, or any other self-inflicted injury</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Expenses arising due to consumption of alcohol/tobacco or drug use/misuse/abuse</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Expenses of spectacles/contact lenses and dental treatment that does not require hospitalisation</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Expenses occurring due or traceable to pregnancy and childbirth, miscarriage, abortion and its consequences</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Any external congenital disease</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Infertility related tests and treatment</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Unlawful activities</p>
	</li>
</ul>
	
