<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
	<div class="container">
		<article>
				<h4>FAQs About Care Supreme</h4>
						</article>
		<article>
			
									<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Can I add my children to the Care Supreme health plan?</h3>

<div>
<p>Yes, you can add up to 2 children and 2 adults under the Care Supreme plan on a family floater basis.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Do I need to undergo medical tests before buying the Care Supreme policy?</h3>

<div>
<p>Yes, depending on your current health status, you might be required to undergo pre-policy health check-ups before opting for the Care Supreme policy.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. Does Care Supreme offer annual health check-ups?</h3>

<div>
<p>Yes, the policy offers the benefit of annual health check-ups as an optional benefit with the base policy. It helps you keep track of your health and take timely preventive measures.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3>Q. What if I exhaust the sum insured limit of the Care Supreme policy?</h3>

<div>
<p>We got you covered throughout a policy year with unlimited automatic recharge of the sum insured under the Care Supreme policy. Your coverage amount will be replenished automatically once you exhaust the limit every time in a given policy year.</p>
</div>
</section>

							</div>
		</article>
	
</section>

